{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Argonauts Path",
    "steam_appid": 3025880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible and fast-paced <strong>roguelike deckbuilding</strong> game where you\u2019ll probably die or become a hero\u2014most likely the former.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/83b8033acf2f11c10a0c49fb6355cd6a.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/83b8033acf2f11c10a0c49fb6355cd6a.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/83b8033acf2f11c10a0c49fb6355cd6a.mp4?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will travel from village to village across the Samothrer region on a path of combat and growth, eventually exiling a Divine and safeguarding humanity for 300 more years. The heroes have been linked to the Argos (the most important divine artifact that records your time, allowing you to return to that moment if you die). You will choose your heroes and embark on a quest to save humanity in a battle against the 7 Divines, corrupt gods with the power to dominate humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/d1bad0c2c262038c68a4a3383668058d.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/d1bad0c2c262038c68a4a3383668058d.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/d1bad0c2c262038c68a4a3383668058d.mp4?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you\u2019ll go through 7 villages where you will find missions and 3 support elements. You\u2019ll play as heroes who grow stronger with each run, and with each level, you\u2019ll be granted the choice of two divine blessings. The missions, what you encounter in each village, as well as the possibility of special rewards during missions, will depend on your luck. Along with the blessings (which heavily influence gameplay), this ensures that each game is different and new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/21e7e28cf946ac583406753ba677bf2a.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/21e7e28cf946ac583406753ba677bf2a.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/21e7e28cf946ac583406753ba677bf2a.mp4?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support elements in the village:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merchant</strong> (you can buy 3 cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shaman</strong> (you can remove and upgrade cards, once for free)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spa</strong> (you can heal all or half of your health)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Artifact</strong> (the first time, it will increase your base health and energy; subsequent times, it will increase your max health in exchange for some health)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions mainly consist of combat encounters against enemies, divided into ranks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st Village - Rank 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2nd Village - Rank 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd Village - Rank 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4th Village - Rank 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5th Village - Rank 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6th Village - Rank 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7th Village - Rank 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the 3 Fallen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/953f7fcbfccdd24a7b2aee3901e30753.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/953f7fcbfccdd24a7b2aee3901e30753.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/953f7fcbfccdd24a7b2aee3901e30753.mp4?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, the missions will sometimes lead you to tough encounters that may kill you. You must weigh whether you are ready to face the challenge and grow stronger by confronting these challenges or continue on your path, which will increase the difficulty of your future encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible and fast-paced <strong>roguelike deckbuilding</strong> game where you\u2019ll probably die or become a hero\u2014most likely the former.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/83b8033acf2f11c10a0c49fb6355cd6a.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/83b8033acf2f11c10a0c49fb6355cd6a.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/83b8033acf2f11c10a0c49fb6355cd6a.mp4?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will travel from village to village across the Samothrer region on a path of combat and growth, eventually exiling a Divine and safeguarding humanity for 300 more years. The heroes have been linked to the Argos (the most important divine artifact that records your time, allowing you to return to that moment if you die). You will choose your heroes and embark on a quest to save humanity in a battle against the 7 Divines, corrupt gods with the power to dominate humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/d1bad0c2c262038c68a4a3383668058d.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/d1bad0c2c262038c68a4a3383668058d.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps