b_paragraph\" >The missions mainly consist of combat encounters against enemies, divided into ranks:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st Village - Rank 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2nd Village - Rank 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd Village - Rank 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4th Village - Rank 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5th Village - Rank 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6th Village - Rank 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7th Village - Rank 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the 3 Fallen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/953f7fcbfccdd24a7b2aee3901e30753.poster.avif?t=1746193667\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/953f7fcbfccdd24a7b2aee3901e30753.webm?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025880/extras/953f7fcbfccdd24a7b2aee3901e30753.mp4?t=1746193667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, the missions will sometimes lead you to tough encounters that may kill you. You must weigh whether you are ready to face the challenge and grow stronger by confronting these challenges or continue on your path, which will increase the difficulty of your future encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
